OL,3,A'Heavy casualties' after fire on cargo
OL,4,Aship in eastern China
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire has broken out on a
OL,7,Fforeign-flagged cargo ship docked at an
OL,8,Feastern Chinese port, causing heavy
OL,9,Fcasualties, according to state media.
OL,11,FPresident Xi Jinping called for urgent
OL,12,Fsearch and rescue efforts and a swift
OL,13,Finvestigation.
OL,15,FPremier Li Qiang called for "trapped"
OL,16,Fpeople to be rescued and stressed the
OL,17,Fneed to "prevent secondary disasters".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
